# Left behind by a packaging run that could not rename its temp directory —
# the Claude desktop app holds a watcher handle on files under the project, so
# electron-builder now writes outside it. Ignored so 117 MB of build output
# cannot be swept in by git add -A while the folder is still locked.
release-363/

